181
00:05:44,640 --> 00:05:46,060
do not set transition to all

182
00:05:46,060 --> 00:05:48,260
We only apply easing to the predetermined values that need to change

183
00:05:48,260 --> 00:05:49,460
Otherwise, it's very prone to issues.

184
00:05:49,460 --> 00:05:51,160
